sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Dosen / Admin
  participant FE as Frontend SIPRITI
  participant API as Backend API
  participant Auth as Auth Service
  participant Proposal as Proposal Service
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant Audit as Audit Log

  User->>FE: Mengirim username dan password
  FE->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>Auth: Validasi kredensial dan status user
  Auth->>DB: Ambil user, role, permission, prodi
  DB-->>Auth: Data user legacy-compatible
  Auth-->>API: User DTO dan token cookie
  API-->>FE: 200 Login berhasil, Set-Cookie JWT, CSRF
  API->>Audit: Catat LOGIN

  User->>FE: Membuat usulan penelitian
  FE->>API: POST /api/penelitian dengan CSRF token
  API->>Proposal: Validasi schema dan permission
  Proposal->>DB: Simpan haki_proposals dan relasi awal
  Proposal-->>API: Response legacy envelope
  API-->>FE: 200/201 data usulan
  API->>Audit: Catat CREATE proposal
